## Plan Execution with Sub-Agents (this repo)

Plans modifying 3+ code files (or any shared library) use sub-agent execution:
verbatim code in plan, error-handling audit per block, fresh sub-agent per batch
with rules injected, main agent verification between batches.
See `reference/plan-execution-detail.md` for the rule injection template.
